OL,3,ALabour beats Greens to win Holborn and
OL,4,ASt Pancras as Polanski faces call to
OL,5,Aresign
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, chair of the Jewish Greens
OL,8,Fgroup Vivien Lichtenstein says leader
OL,9,FZack Polanski should resign over his
OL,10,Fhandling of the party's motion
OL,11,Fdeclaring Zionism is a form of racism -
OL,12,Fwatch this explainer on what it means
OL,14,FEarlier, speaking to BBC Breakfast,
OL,15,FPolanski said he wouldn't have voted
OL,16,Ffor the motion - passed by Green Party
OL,17,Fmembers last weekend - in its current
OL,18,Fform. Here are the amendments he
OL,19,Fpreviously called for, which were
OL,20,Frejected
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
