OL,3,AI would not have voted for Zionism
OL,4,Amotion, Polanski says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion defined Zionism as an
OL,7,Fideology supporting "an
OL,8,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" and
OL,9,Fbacked a "single democratic Palestinian
OL,10,Fstate in all of historic Palestine",
OL,11,Fwhich includes modern-day Israel.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/41
