OL,3,AFort Hood survivor supports gunman's
OL,4,Aexecution by firing squad but questions
OL,5,Alivestream
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut while Lunsford agreed with the
OL,8,Fmethod of execution, he said it was
OL,9,F"not something you should view for
OL,10,Fentertainment purposes".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/41
